Familiarisation of ICs — 7400, 7404, 7486

Aim

To familiarize ourselves with the pin configuration and operation of IC 7400, 7404 and 7486.

ICs Used

IC	Gate

7400	NAND
7404	NOT
7486	EX-OR/XOR


Procedure

1. Identify the required IC.


2. Place the IC correctly on the breadboard.


3. Connect VCC (+5V) and GND.


4. Identify the input and output pins from the pin diagram.


5. Apply different input combinations.


6. Observe the output through LED.


7. Verify the output with the corresponding truth table.



Result

The pin configuration and operation of IC 7400, 7404 and 7486 were successfully studied.
